Do not trust claimed identity values supplied only in client headers.

Do not accept INPUT_EVENT, FILE_COMMAND, APP_COMMAND, or DIAGNOSTICS_RUN unless an authenticated and approved session authorizes that action.

Do not broadcast sensitive device commands to every connected receiver.

Use explicit recipient and active-session ownership checks.

Remove the hardcoded fallback JWT secret.

Never expose TURN shared secrets in public JavaScript.

Keep all remote interactions visible to the receiving owner.

